      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "features that should be added to vrc\n-optional colored name tags based on friends and ranks. (settings)\n-teleportation for non-game worlds\n-player list to see all users (blocked or not) with ctrl+e that shows fps and ping\n-show avatar author for friends in the friends list (not same lobby instance)\n-optifine (zoom button) with alt key\n-avatar hider (unrenders avatars from a certain distance.)\n-avatar searching and allowing avatars to be USED but not ADDED to lists without VRC+\n-friends+ home (having your default home world be friends+)\n-settings restart (adds a restart button in settings and while loading into worlds\n-user history (shows last time they were online and when you were FIRST friended.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
