  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-26T07:02:48.368Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add features from the mods below-\n-Avatar Hider (unrenders avatars from a certain distance.)\n-BTKSANameplateFix (changes the colors of usernames based on rank or friend)\n-emmvrc (avatar searching and infinte avatar faves from VRC+, also adds a list of players, their ping and fps rate. also includes blocked users.)\n-Friends+Home (having your default home world be friends+)\n-NotOptfine (allows you to press a keybind to zoom in)\n-SettingsRestart (adds a restart button in settings)\n-UIExpansion (allows to find avatar author from users not in the same world)\n-UserHistory (shows last time they were online.)\nOther things we need are closed captions, text to speech, OPTIMIZATION,",
